                "naturalExpression": "I’m expecting a package tomorrow. Would you mind accepting it for me?",
                "explanation": "“receive my package”能理解；邻里代收常说“take in / accept a package for me”。"
              },
              "rewards": [
                {
                  "type": "stat",
                  "stat": "speaking",
                  "amount": 1
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
