                "assessment": "自然、符合当前情景",
                "naturalExpression": "I’ll text you if I get any updates from the delivery driver.",
                "explanation": "“will”在这里交代接下来的决定或行动，让对方知道自己会怎样继续。"
              },
              "rewards": [
                {
                  "type": "stat",
                  "stat": "speaking",
                  "amount": 3
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
